5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who we sit beside. It decides how much we actually talk. Let’s check the joiners' reports and the spring project strands.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current layout hides who gets the worse seats. I need to see the drawn plan against the staff survey to expose that.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I’m worried about the budget. The floor billing basis and the facilities quote for re-running power seem important to check.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,My morning gaps are tiny! I need to know the morning routine on the pilot floor and the unplanned seat shuffles.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Comfort is key. I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio's note from the workstation check.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, your gaps are precious. But if we sit closer, we might save time on handovers. Let’s see what the joiners said.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, proximity is nice, but fairness is structural. I need to know if the plan explicitly assigns the interior-wall seats.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. If the billing is by area, empty desks still cost us. I need to verify the monthly hit.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, money is scary! But if the move takes days, I lose my whole week. Speed is my priority.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, speed is irrelevant if the chair hurts. I need acoustic and ergonomic certainty. I’m checking the sound and physio notes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I hear you. But if we’re too comfortable, we stop talking. I want to see how the joiners learned the work.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, learning is good, but resentment is bad. I must ensure the worse seats are named, not left to habit.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I’m a bit quiet, but I feel the weight of the costs. I hope the billing basis shows a way to save.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, don’t worry! We’ll figure it out. I just need to know if the shuffles will eat my mornings.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I’ll handle the comfort. You handle the time. Let’s see what the data says.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the joiners' reports and the spring project strands. Let’s see how we connect.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I’ll check the drawn plan against the staff survey and the badge records. I need to see the unfairness and the arrival times.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the floor billing basis and the facilities quote. I need to know the true cost.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’ll check the morning routine and the unplanned shuffles. I need to protect my gaps.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I’ll check the sound meter readings and the physio's note. I need my comfort secured.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
