35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The joiners learned by overhearing! And last spring, questions were answered across the aisle. We need to sit where we can talk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, the plan gives four desks a window and three to the interior wall. Daylight was the top complaint. We must name who takes the wall seats.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, that’s harsh. But the billing is by area, not headcount. Two empty desks cost 41,000 yen a month. We need to be efficient.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, 41,000 yen is huge! But the morning routine took up to nine minutes per person. That’s too long for my gaps.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, nine minutes is nothing compared to the noise. The printer row is nine decibels louder. I need the window side.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, the window is quiet, but the joiners need to hear us. If we hide in quiet spots, we lose the team.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, hiding is not the issue. The issue is that the three interior-wall seats are never assigned. I want them named.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. If we name them, we can rotate them? Or maybe we just accept the cost? I’m not sure.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, rotating sounds exhausting! The unplanned shuffles took two weeks each time. I can’t do that again.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, shuffles are chaos. I need a fixed, quiet spot. The physio said it takes days to settle a good chair setting.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I get the comfort. But if we’re fixed, we stop mixing. The joiners said overhearing was key. Let’s find a middle ground.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, a middle ground is just another way to hide the unfairness. I want explicit assignment. Who takes the wall?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I’m worried about the cost of moving. The facilities quote is 6,200 yen per desk. Every change adds up.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, 6,200 yen per move is painful! If we rotate, we pay that every time. I need stability.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, stability is good. But if I’m stuck in the noisy row, I can’t work. I need the window.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, I understand. But if everyone takes the best spot, who talks to whom? I want us to connect.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, connection is nice, but fairness is essential. I will vote for the option that forces us to name the worse seats.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I’m leaning towards stability. The costs of moving are too high. I hope we can keep the current spots.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, I agree! Stability protects my gaps. I don’t want to pay 6,200 yen every month.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I agree. I need my window seat. I’m voting for the option that keeps my spot fixed.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
