60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Option B fixes desks by function. It’s stable, but does it let us talk? The joiners need to hear us.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B assigns seats permanently. I can name the interior-wall seats. This is the only option that forces fairness.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Option B means no more moving. No more 6,200 yen fees. It’s the most budget-friendly. I’m leaning B.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option B is stable! No shuffles, no delays. My gaps are safe. I’m voting B.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B secures my window seat. I can adjust my chair once and stay. I’m voting B.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, if we name the wall seats, will we still talk? I worry we’ll just sit in silence.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, silence is better than resentment. If we name the seats, we acknowledge the burden. That’s fair.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, I think it’s okay. We can still talk across the aisle. The joiners did last spring.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Daisuke, that’s true! We can still connect. And I keep my morning routine. I’m happy with B.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Mio, I’m happy too. My comfort is secured. I’m voting B.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, I’ll support B if we promise to check in on the wall-sitters. Let’s not let them feel isolated.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shizue, agreed. We will name the seats and check in. Option B is the only fair choice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, I agree. The budget is safe. I’m voting B.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, I’m voting B! Stability and connection. It’s perfect.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Toshio, I’m voting B. Comfort and fairness. It’s the right choice.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,"I’m voting B. Let’s make sure we talk to everyone, even the wall-sitters.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
